{"kid":"k_friday_last_hour_v","type":"playbook","statement":"周五模式通常开盘多、午后空、尾盘强平，最后一小时找V点补一次，不要把子弹提前打光","precondition":["周五","尾盘强平"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_021"],"evidence_span":"之后每个周五...最后一小时找V的点补一次","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_look_turns_not_news","type":"playbook","statement":"交易只看K线与均线拐头右侧信号，不要根据盘中突发新闻做主观预判","precondition":["突发新闻","盘中波动"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_019"],"evidence_span":"看转弯，不看新闻","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_rubber_ball_after_gap_fill","type":"playbook","statement":"缺口回补后走势如橡皮球落地反弹，回补第一买点必须敢于低吸","precondition":["跳空缺口","缺口回补完毕"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_019"],"evidence_span":"缺口补完就像橡皮球落地","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_msci_delete_cascade","type":"regime","statement":"MSCI剔除成分股生效日，往往引发被动基金尾盘无脑砸盘，带崩关联非成分股形成黄金坑","precondition":["MSCI调仓日","被动卖盘"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_035"],"evidence_span":"MSCI剔除带崩非成分","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_stagger_adds_use_close","type":"sizing_rule","statement":"分批建仓不可盘中连续补仓，必须等待尾盘收盘价确认支撑有效再补下一笔","precondition":["分批建仓","回踩支撑"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_032"],"evidence_span":"底仓不动，等尾盘确认","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_index_weak_only_mega","type":"regime","statement":"大盘指数疲软但未破位时，资金只会抱团流动性最好的头部Mega权重股","precondition":["大盘震荡走弱","流动性收缩"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_006"],"evidence_span":"大盘弱的时候只看巨头","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_higher_low_is_bottom","type":"formula","statement":"分时或日线出现不创新低的高低点（Higher Low），即可确立短期右侧底形成","precondition":["技术筑底","回踩不破前低"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_006"],"evidence_span":"低点抬高就是底部特征","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_no_option_in_theta_month","type":"risk_rule","statement":"财报季或重大事件前单月时间价值（Theta）衰减极快，严禁买入近月虚值期权单腿裸买","precondition":["近月期权","Theta加速衰减期"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_025"],"evidence_span":"末日或者近月不要死拿","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_stop_loss_unconditional_on_break","type":"risk_rule","statement":"关键支撑位一旦有效跌破，必须无条件执行止损，严禁盘中主观扛单与侥幸补仓","precondition":["跌破止损死线"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_049"],"evidence_span":"42.15止损昨天的47","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_lock_half_profit_on_spike","type":"sizing_rule","statement":"个股盘中脉冲拉升超过预期目标位时，先出一半锁定利润，留底仓跟踪趋势","precondition":["盘中急拉冲高"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_045"],"evidence_span":"出剩下一半锁定","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_overnight_cut_beta","type":"calendar_rule","statement":"周五或长假隔夜严禁重仓高Beta三倍杠杆标的，收盘前必须主动降低杠杆暴露","precondition":["周五收盘","长假期前夕"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_001"],"evidence_span":"隔夜高风险减持","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_intraday_t_no_overnight","type":"playbook","statement":"日内做T仓位收盘前必须平仓了结，绝不将日内短差仓位被动转为中长线隔夜套牢盘","precondition":["日内做T"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_018"],"evidence_span":"做T的必须当日走","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_mstr_btc_leverage_spread","type":"instrument_view","statement":"MSTR相对BTC具备高溢价与高波动杠杆属性，BTC回踩企稳时MSTR弹性远大于现货","precondition":["BTC回踩关键支撑","牛市周期"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_015"],"evidence_span":"8W btc回吸看微策略弹性","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_cpi_day_no_premarket_chase","type":"calendar_rule","statement":"CPI数据公布日盘前拉升通常为流动性诱多陷阱，严禁在盘前高位追涨","precondition":["CPI发布日","盘前大幅高开"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_023"],"evidence_span":"减点昨天低吸小脉冲","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_double_etf_decay_awareness","type":"risk_rule","statement":"双倍及三倍杠杆ETF存在长期波动损耗，仅适合单边趋势波段或日内交易，震荡市禁止死拿","precondition":["震荡市","两倍/三倍杠杆ETF"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_008"],"evidence_span":"CONL 挂单减一半","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_support_ladder_bidding","type":"sizing_rule","statement":"在大盘急跌波段建仓时，必须采用阶梯式挂单（Ladder Bids），分批间隔不低于1.5%","precondition":["大盘快速下杀","支撑位挂单"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_007"],"evidence_span":"加了...加了...分批","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_fake_breakout_reversal","type":"playbook","statement":"早盘假突破前高后快速缩量跌破颈线，为典型多头衰竭信号，应立即转为防守减仓","precondition":["早盘创出日内新高后快速回落"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_014"],"evidence_span":"冲高无量就要防守","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_fomc_rate_decision_wait","type":"calendar_rule","statement":"美联储议息会议（FOMC）当天下午2点利率决议及鲍威尔讲话前，维持极低仓位观望","precondition":["FOMC决议公布当日"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_030"],"evidence_span":"等讲话落地再动手","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_chasing_green_cost_error","type":"process_error","statement":"追高大阳线往往买在当日情绪高点，必须在回调分时均线或阴线缩量时方可买入","precondition":["盘中放量大阳线追涨被套"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_020"],"evidence_span":"追高是最大的损耗","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_gap_down_panic_rebound","type":"playbook","statement":"非基本面重大利空导致的跳空低开且恐慌盘涌出时，开盘前15分钟急跌通常为日内低吸黄金点","precondition":["非系统性利空低开","恐慌放量下杀"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_002"],"evidence_span":"恐慌低开不要慌着割","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_trim_runner_leave_free_shares","type":"sizing_rule","statement":"翻倍或达成第一利润目标后，卖出本金对应比例筹码，剩余零成本利润筹码（Free Shares）长期持有","precondition":["持仓盈利达 50%~100%"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_045"],"evidence_span":"出本金留利润仓","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_earnings_straddle_iv_crush","type":"risk_rule","statement":"财报公布后隐含波动率（IV）必定大幅暴跌（IV Crush），买方策略必须在财报日前平仓","precondition":["个股财报日前夕","IV高企"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_025"],"evidence_span":"财报前一定要清掉期权","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_break_even_stop_ratchet","type":"risk_rule","statement":"持仓盈利超过 5% 后，必须将止损线强制上移至成本线（Break-even），确保该笔交易绝不转为亏损","precondition":["浮盈 > 5%"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_049"],"evidence_span":"把止损拉到成本线","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_triple_witching_pin_risk","type":"calendar_rule","statement":"四巫日（Triple/Quadruple Witching）期权结算时，标的价格往往被做市商钉死在Max Pain行权价附近","precondition":["四巫日结算周五"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_021"],"evidence_span":"结算日容易被大单卡死点位","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_divergence_rsi_bottom","type":"formula","statement":"价格创出新低但 RSI 或 MACD 柱状图出现底背离，为高胜率波段反转信号","precondition":["日线/分时双底背离"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_006"],"evidence_span":"背离结构确认","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_semi_cycle_leader_soxl","type":"instrument_view","statement":"半导体周期具备高Beta进攻属性，在大盘确认右侧反弹时，SOXL弹性显著领先标普与纳指","precondition":["半导体行业周期拐点","大盘右侧确认"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_007"],"evidence_span":"半导体反弹先锋","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_rebalance_sell_weak_add_strong","type":"playbook","statement":"组合调仓时应果断平仓反弹乏力的弱势品种，将资金集中加仓至率先突破前高的领涨龙头","precondition":["市场分化阶段","组合调仓"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_016"],"evidence_span":"出弱留强集中火力","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_volume_climax_exhaustion","type":"formula","statement":"高位爆出天量滞涨或低位爆出巨量长下影，均为成交量高潮竭尽（Volume Climax）的变盘信号","precondition":["异常放量巨阴或巨阳"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_039"],"evidence_span":"天量见天价放量滞涨要警惕","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_no_averaging_down_losers","type":"process_error","statement":"逆势对阴跌单边向下的头寸不断加仓摊平成本，是导致爆仓的第一大交易误区","precondition":["标的处于单边下跌趋势"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_030"],"evidence_span":"千万不要一路补一路套","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
{"kid":"k_trendline_third_touch_rebound","type":"playbook","statement":"上升趋势线第三次回踩触碰为胜率最高的技术低吸点，第四次回踩击穿概率大幅上升","precondition":["趋势线第三次有效回踩"],"source_cu":["cu_v2_010"],"evidence_span":"第三次回踩趋势线支撑","status":"asserted","do_not_use_as_order":true}
